<title>UK: London precious metals finish lower except gold.</title>
<headline>London precious metals finish lower except gold.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $344.40/$344.90 up 60 cents from Thursday. Attempted to breach $345.00 resistance earlier but met selling. Producers sales likely to limit upside.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished down four cents on profit taking at $4.73/$4.75 after overnight rise. Lease rates also rose.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down about $7.00 at $402.00/$406.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Off about $4.50 at $178.00/$181.00.</p>
</text>
